{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo codes for orders and subscription upgrades. Both paths use one pricing helper to apply the discount before tax and clamp the discounted subtotal at zero. Percentage discounts round half up to the nearest cent. Orders include any legacy fee in the eligible subtotal, and upgrades use the prorated price difference.\n\nInvalid or ineligible promos raise `ValidationError` before a charge is recorded. Upgrade retries return the original entry, and changing `promo_code` or `as_of` under the same idempotency key raises `ValidationError`.\n\nAdded five promo tests. `run_checks.py` exited 0 with all 13 tests passing."}}
